# Student Portal Demo

## 📌 Project Idea
This is a simple student portal application designed to help students and administrators manage academic information efficiently.

## 🎯 Features
- Student Registration and Login
- View Student Profile
- Course Enrollment
- View Marks and Attendance
- Admin Dashboard

## 💻 Technologies Used
- Frontend: HTML, CSS
- Backend: Python (Flask)
- Database: SQLite

## 🚀 Future Enhancements
- Online assignment submission
- Notifications system
- Mobile-friendly UI

